---
description: Security rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Security rules:

- Validate all user input.
- Never trust request data directly.
- Use authorization checks for protected actions.
- Avoid mass assignment vulnerabilities.
- Never expose .env values, secrets, API keys or credentials.
- Do not log sensitive payment, tenant or personal data.
- Prevent cross-tenant data leaks.
- Check file uploads carefully.
- Prefer explicit allow-lists over broad access.
